OL,3,GNEWSAOn top of the tallest building in
OL,4,Athe world
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm not the kind of guy to be scared
OL,7,Fand freak out but it was the scariest
OL,8,Fthing I've ever done."
OL,10,FThe Burj Khalifa in Dubai is the
OL,11,Fworld's tallest building, standing 828m
OL,12,F(2,716ft) high.
OL,14,FJust a handful of people have stood on
OL,15,Fthe very top of it, from actors Tom
OL,16,FCruise and Will Smith to YouTuber Jimmy
OL,17,FDonaldson aka Mr Beast and French urban
OL,18,Fclimber Alain Robert.
OL,20,FFour years ago, motorbike racer Sam
OL,21,FSunderland, from Poole in Dorset,
OL,22,Fjoined this select group.
